@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> RegistrationCheck
state RegistrationCheck <<choice>>
state PatientDashboard
state HealthWorkerDashboard
state GovernmentOfficialDashboard
state Logout

RegistrationCheck : registration completed [valid] --> CompletedRegistration
CompletedRegistration : enter as patient [valid] --> PatientDashboard
PatientDashboard : provide medical information [valid] --> ProvideInfo
ProvideInfo : check and use info [valid] --> AnalyzeInfo
AnalyzeInfo : prepare alerts [valid] --> PrepareAlerts
PrepareAlerts : send to patient or health worker [valid] --> SendAlerts

CompletedRegistration : enter as health worker [valid] --> HealthWorkerDashboard
HealthWorkerDashboard : check medical information [valid] --> CheckInfo
CheckInfo : use for analysis [valid] --> UseInfo
UseInfo : prepare alerts [valid] --> PrepareAlerts
PrepareAlerts : send to patient or health worker [valid] --> SendAlerts

CompletedRegistration : enter as government official [valid] --> GovernmentOfficialDashboard
GovernmentOfficialDashboard : display planning results [valid] --> DisplayResults
DisplayResults : logout [invalid] --> Logout

Logout --> [*] : AccessEnded [invalid]
@enduml
